levels.rules:
The overall rules apply to this level as well.

To get to these levels all you have to do is: 
- Open the compass on your hotbar; 
- Click on UHC Champions (golden apple);
- Walk forward until you find a "solo" bot;
- Click on that bot and join a game. You will be sent to a waiting lobby. 
- Now you can either turn right (west facing in-game), or turn left (east facing in-game) and you have the 2 new levels. 

